Purpose: Register Corvid's software authenticator as the platform (internal) discovery on Linux.
Area: passkeys
Files: device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc (hook in Create for kInternal / platform path), device/fido/BUILD.gn (dep on //corvid/passkeys)
Rebase risk: medium because FidoDiscoveryFactory API has been reshaped several times
Origin: original
Status: UNVERIFIED SKETCH.

--- a/device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc
+++ b/device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc
@@ std::unique_ptr<FidoDiscoveryBase> FidoDiscoveryFactory::Create(FidoTransportProtocol transport) @@
+#if BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)
+  if (transport == FidoTransportProtocol::kInternal)
+    return std::make_unique<corvid::passkeys::SoftwareDiscovery>();
+#endif
